Spectrum vNext integration

Feature forecasting is adapted from Spectrum (Han et al., CVPR 2026,
https://github.com/hanjq17/Spectrum), from the ComfyUI-Spectrum-KSampler
implementation (https://github.com/sorryhyun/ComfyUI-Spectrum-KSampler), and
from upstream Forge Neo's Spectrum forecaster, itself taken from
comfyui-spectrum-sdxl (https://github.com/ruwwww/comfyui-spectrum-sdxl). All
three are MIT-licensed; their notices follow.

The SEA decision metric implements the equations described in SeaCache:
Spectral-Evolution-Aware Cache for Accelerating Diffusion Models.

Forge Neo integration, lifecycle guards, GUI, cache persistence, and
compatibility policies are maintained in this repository.

